Speech segment inventories go here (inv/tdp/*.tdi, inv/lpc/*, ...).

They are not part of the source tree; they are distributed separately and
some of them have their own licence terms (see COPYING.DB in the inventory
packages).  The time domain inventories for the Czech voices "machac" and
"violka" are available as epos-tdp.tgz from
https://sourceforge.net/projects/epos/files/voices/

Without inventories Epos still starts and can transcribe text; it only
cannot produce sound for the voices whose inventory is missing.
